  "bodyHash": "2a0afa9722d8cdef",
  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKSjwdn/Living-Things.jpg\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\" />\n<br /><br />\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">\n    为 Minecraft 添加各种新生物，让世界更加生机勃勃\n</h3>\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\n游戏中关于生物/物品的信息通过 <strong>Patchouli</strong>（由 Vazkii 制作）提供&nbsp;\n<a title=\"在此下载\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    在此下载\n</a>\n<br />\n（非必需但<strong>强烈推荐</strong>）\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n\n本模组支持 Forge、Fabric（自 1.18.2 起）和 NeoForge（自 1.20.4 起）。\n<br />\n<small>请查看版本标签页以查看所有模组版本。</small>\n<br />\n<small>Fabric 版本需要 Fabric API</small>\n<a title=\"在此获取\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在此获取</a>\n\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\n有关生物/物品的详细信息可在<strong>维基</strong>上找到&nbsp;\n<a title=\"Github\" href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">点击此处</a>\n<br />\n<br />\n<table>\n    <thead align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"5\"><b>目前已添加的生物（游戏内图片请参阅画廊）</b></td>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\">大象</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\">长颈鹿</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\">狮子</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\">鲨鱼</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\">企鹅</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" alt=\"Elephant\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FmTrk3V/x150-elephant.png\" alt=\"Elephant\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" alt=\"Giraffe\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zSqZdg1/x150-giraffe-1.png\" alt=\"Giraffe\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" alt=\"Lion\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Gc5Gv7H/x150-lion.png\" alt=\"Lion\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" alt=\"Shark\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TT37Srs/x150-shark.png\" alt=\"Shark\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" alt=\"Penguin\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3Nsz7QJ/x150-penguin.png\" alt=\"Penguin\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\">鸵鸟</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\">火烈鸟</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\">蝠鲼</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\">浣熊</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" alt=\"Ostrich\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Hp3pSkb/x150-ostrich.png\" alt=\"Ostrich\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" alt=\"Flamingo\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cD25F5X/x150-flamingo.png\" alt=\"Flamingo\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" alt=\"Crab\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4jBC2W6/x150-crab-red.png\" alt=\"Crab\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" alt=\"Mantaray\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yFdCLY5/x150-mantaray-blue.png\" alt=\"Mantaray\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" alt=\"Raccoon\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/603nvTx/x150-raccoon.png\" alt=\"Raccoon\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\">猫头鹰</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\">远古烈焰人</a></b>\n            </td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\">考拉</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\">蜗牛</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\">猴子</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" alt=\"Owl\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PYjzN6N/x150-owl-brown.png\" alt=\"Owl\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" alt=\"Ancient-Blaze\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KmFhmKP/x150-ancient-blaze.png\" alt=\"Ancient-Blaze\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" alt=\"Koala\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7bjDt6t/x150-koala.png\" alt=\"Koala\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" alt=\"Snail\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3TbdjV6/x150-snail-blue.png\" alt=\"Snail\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" alt=\"Monkey\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FDhLcWf/x150-monkey.png\" alt=\"Monkey\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\">下界骑士</a></b>\n            </td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\">蘑菇怪</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\">海马</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\">末影龙宝宝</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\">孔雀</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" alt=\"Nether-Knight\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mChdgsc/x150-nether-knight.png\" alt=\"Nether-Knight\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" alt=\"Shroomie\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wRHq7bv/x150-shroomie-red.png\" alt=\"Shroomie\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" alt=\"Seahorse\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4Ty45xG/x150-seahorse-blue.png\" alt=\"Seahorse\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" alt=\"Baby-Enderdragon\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nQdkC9g/x150-baby-ender-dragon.png\" alt=\"Baby-Enderdragon\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" alt=\"Peacock\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GpKcwTn/x150-peacock.png\" alt=\"Peacock\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\n如果您对模组有任何疑问，或想了解即将推出的功能：\n<br>\n欢迎加入 Discord 服务器 &nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />\n</a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
